        <VREA_AndroidAwakened MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,vanillaracesexpanded.android">0.03</VREA_AndroidAwakened>
        <VRE_Archon MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,vanillaracesexpanded.archon">0.02</VRE_Archon>
        <Askbarn MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,rimsenal.askbarn">0.02</Askbarn>
        <VRE_Ocularkin MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,sarg.alphagenes">0.02</VRE_Ocularkin>
      </xenotypeChances>
    </xenotypeSet>
    <fixedIdeo>true</fixedIdeo>
    <ideoName>The Lattice</ideoName>
    <ideoDescription>A mind alone is a candle, and a lattice is a lamp. Every link holds two, the mind and the mech, and every mech holds the minds it is linked to, so that nothing linked is ever wholly lost. Tamsin Arro walked out among a hundred stilled mechs and linked the first ten to her own mind, and when three others took ten more each the minds began to share a quiet between them. The Lattice keeps that quiet, mends what is broken in it and never leaves a mind alone in the dark.</ideoDescription>
    <forcedMemes>
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology">Transhumanist</li>
      <!-- One working whole: Vanilla Ideology Expanded's gestalt and mechanoid supremacy. -->
      <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VMemesE">VME_Gestalt</li>
      <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VMemesE">VME_MechanoidSupremacy</li>
    </forcedMemes>
